Made devices, with you as Sam.
Send this link to the people you want in it. It works for a day, while this computer is on:

  svrngs://join/<the token>

or, to open it in a browser:

  http://localhost:60387/#<the token>

On a phone, each app opens at an address of its own under localhost:60387, which can see which app is opened.

devices's folder is /tmp/devices-run/sam/svrngs/devices: what anyone in devices puts there reaches this computer, and what you put there reaches theirs.

Leave this running; Ctrl-C stops it.
